    "body": "## Motivation\n\nLoading any AWQ-quantized model on CUDA crashes at weight load with:\n\n```\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'sglang.kernel_api_logging'\n```\n\nFull traceback (main @ fd5c52588f, 8xGPU, DeepSeek-V3.2-AWQ):\n\n```\n  File \"python/sglang/srt/models/deepseek_v2.py\", line 3436, in load_weights\n    self.do_load_weights(weights, is_nextn)\n  File \"python/sglang/srt/models/deepseek_common/deepseek_weight_loader.py\", line 550, in do_load_weights\n    self.post_load_weights(is_nextn=is_nextn, weight_names=weight_names)\n  File \"python/sglang/srt/models/deepseek_common/deepseek_weight_loader.py\", line 627, in post_load_weights\n    awq_dequantize_f = awq_dequantize_func()\n  File \"python/sglang/srt/models/deepseek_common/utils.py\", line 104, in awq_dequantize_func\n    from sglang.kernel_api_logging import debug_kernel_api\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'sglang.kernel_api_logging'\n```\n\nRoot cause: #35062 ([Misc] Clean up python/sglang package structure) moved\n`kernel_api_logging.py` into the `sglang.kernels` subpackage, but the CUDA\nbranch of `awq_dequantize_func` was missed. The HIP and NPU branches of the\nsame function already import from the correct location, which makes the\ninconsistency easy to confirm:\n\n```python\n# python/sglang/srt/models/deepseek_common/utils.py (main @ fd5c52588f)\nif _is_cuda:\n    from sglang.kernel_api_logging import debug_kernel_api          # line 104: stale path\nelif _is_hip:\n    from sglang.kernels.kernel_api_logging import debug_kernel_api  # correct\nelif _is_npu:\n    from sglang.kernels.kernel_api_logging import debug_kernel_api  # correct\n```\n\n`python/sglang/kernel_api_logging.py` does not exist on main;\n`python/sglang/kernels/kernel_api_logging.py` does (`git ls-tree` confirms both).\n\n## Modifications\n\nOne line in `python/sglang/srt/models/deepseek_common/utils.py`:\n\n```diff\n     if _is_cuda:\n-        from sglang.kernel_api_logging import debug_kernel_api\n+        from sglang.kernels.kernel_api_logging import debug_kernel_api\n         from sglang.kernels.ops.quantization.awq_dequantize import awq_dequantize\n```\n\n## Verification\n\n- 8xH20 GPU container (lmsysorg/sglang:nightly-dev-efa-20261026), DeepSeek-V3.2-AWQ:\n  - Before: server dies at weight load with the ModuleNotFoundError above (reproduced twice).\n  - After this one-line change: weight load completes, server serves requests normally end to end.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40295775886](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40295775886)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40295775917](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40295775917)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40295775930](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40295775930)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
